description:
CPH Zine Fest Market is filled with artists who does selfpublished DIY magazines (zines), art books and small press. We’re so excited to celebrate DIY culture with you and we have packed Kapelvej 44 with around 60 zine artists different from OCT 18TH in Ungdomshuset. Dont miss out on the oppurtunity to explore the rebellious artistic expression of the “little artist”.

FREE ENTRANCE!!

