-SAFER SPACE-
CPH Zine Fest always strives to be a safer space with no room for discrimination, racism, harassment, sexism any other aggressive behavior. If anyone is crossing your boundaries in any way or you witness someone else's boundaries being crossed, please tell the organizers at the event. They will wear a CPH Zine Fest logo on their shirt. The organizers has the right to remove any festival visitors, who do not follow the safe space principles.

-ACCESSIBILITY-
Half of the venue is accessible with a wheelchair and there’s a handicap toilet. Please contact us for further information.



Supported by Statens Kunsfond.

This event is a part of CPH Zine Fest 2025, you can find the rest of the program here: https://fb.me/e/6sL98qwWs
